  "description": "ESA says its Hera spacecraft has reached the Didymos asteroid pair, the target NASA's DART probe hit in 2022. DART shortened the orbit of the moon Dimorphos by about 33 minutes; Hera will now measure its mass, shape and impact scar. Full-resolution images are due on November 25.\n\nSources: ESA Hera mission pages, Tech Times, Starlust, Universe Today, Space.com.\n\n#science #space #asteroid #ESA",
